{"text": "The next day no one dared to ask him why he wore the veil, and even a deputation from the church sat speechless before him and returned without an answer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But there was one person in the village who was not frightened by the veil, and she was Elizabeth, the young woman to whom he was engaged. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There is nothing terrible in this piece of crape, she said calmly, so come, good sir, let the sun shine from behind the cloud. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There is an hour to come when all of us shall cast aside our veils, he answered, so do not be offended if I wear it till then. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She warned him gently that people were beginning to whisper that he was hiding his face because of some secret sin. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If I hide my face for sorrow, there is cause enough, he replied, and if I cover it for secret sin, what mortal might not do the same. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the terror of the veil fell upon Elizabeth too, and when he begged her not to desert him, she asked him to lift it but once. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Never, It cannot be, he replied, and Elizabeth, saying farewell, slowly departed, pausing at the door to give one long, shuddering gaze at the veil.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "n", "e", "x", "t", " ", "d", "a", "y", " ", "n", "o", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "d", "a", "r", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "a", "s", "k", " ", "h", "i", "m", " ", "w", "h", "y", " ", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "r", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "v", "e", "i", "l", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "e", "v", "e", "n", " ", "a", " ", "d", "e", "p", "u", "t", "a", "t", "i", "o", "n", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "h", "u", "r", "c", "h", " ", "s", "a", "t", " ", "s", "p", "e", "e", "c", "h", "l", "e", "s", "s", " ", "b", "e", "f", "o", "r", "e", " ", "h", "i", "m", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "r", "e", "t", "u", "r", "n", "e", "d", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", "o", "u", "t",